{"check":"client_zed","fails_when":"tau isn't wired into that client's settings, or the wiring is stale — a dead `command` path or wrong `args` counts as stale; the row is absent entirely when the client isn't installed — except under `tau doctor --client <name>`, which reports a not-installed skip instead of silence","remediation":"run `tau setup --client zed` to wire or refresh it — `tau doctor --fix` auto-fixes the bridge/ACP clients and writes a paste-ready snippet for the manual ones; guide: docs/clients/zed.md","docs":"https://github.com/javimosch/tau/blob/master/docs/troubleshooting.md#setup--config-problems--tau-doctor"}
